      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This report describes a case of stent implantation in a right internal carotid artery with severe distal tortuosity, which caused difficulty in advancing a filter protection device. Advancement of the introducing sheath at the level of the carotid bifurcation and exchange for a third-generation distal filter protection device overcame the problem."},
